    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: underground mines and tunnels.\n\nDustcap is a squat grey mushroom found in abandoned workings and beneath timber supports. Its cap is covered by a dense layer of powder that puffs outward at the slightest vibration, while the fibrous flesh filters impurities from damp cave air. Once rendered harmless and finely milled, a carefully measured pinch coats the nose and throat with a dry protective film. For 30 minutes, you gain a +2-item bonus to Fortitude saves against inhaled poisons and airborne diseases.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
